+Optimize your portfolio efficiently with our
+Collateral Swap
+feature, located on your Dashboard under Supplied Assets. This tool allows you to exchange supplied asset for another in a single transaction, bypassing the need to manually withdraw and re-deposit funds.
+Quick Guide:
+Pick your currentt collateral asset: Choose which supplied asset you want to swap.
+Choose your target asset: Select the asset you’d rather use as collateral.
+Swap: Confirm the amount and swap in one click.
